=2 Walkthrough
* Head to the (north) **Walnut door** at on the top floor of {z:Tavnazian Safehold} (K-7) for a cutscene. You will receive the {@k} {p:Mysterious amulet}.
** Make sure you go to the Walnut Door at (K-7), {n:Parelbriaux} on widescan stands outside. There's another (south) Walnut Door at (K-9) that will not work.
** Speak with {n:Justinius} at (J-6) to learn of Ulmia's whereabouts. __(Optional)__
* Head to the **Dilapidated Gate** to **Snowmint Point** at (I-11) in {z:Misareaux Coast} for a cutscene.
** Taking Homepoint #3 near {n:Justinius} to Homepoint #1 in {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and then taking the southern exit (H-6) to {z:Misareaux Coast} will get you there fastest.
* Return to {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and approach the bridge at (H/I-8) on the main floor for another cutscene.
** Teleport to Homepoint #1 in {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and then head south towards the bridge.

